## Requirements

- [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) — dependency management
{%- if project_layout == 'product' %}
- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) — once the frontend exists (see `frontend/decide-frontend-style.md`)
{%- endif %}
{%- if use_ml %}
- [DVC](https://dvc.org/) — data and pipeline versioning (installed as dev dependency)
{%- endif %}
- [graphify](https://github.com/Graphify-Labs/graphify) *(optional)* — codebase knowledge graph for AI assistants
- [rtk](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk) *(optional)* — filters/compresses command output before it reaches an agent's context

These tools are installed once per machine, not per project: `setup.sh` checks for the required ones and tells you how to install what's missing.

