## Contributing

1. Pick or create an issue using one of the templates in `.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/`
2. Create a branch: `git checkout -b feat/your-feature`
3. Make your changes — `make fix` before committing. Commits only run fast checks (formatting, large files, secrets, type check); run `make test` when you want the suite, CI runs it on every push
4. Open a PR using the pull request template
5. CI must pass before merging
